gate PROGRESS-001
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "Did the worker produce an observable result before the configured fifteen-minute window ended?"
evidence progress,window,observed_at
YES PROGRESS-002
NO SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-PROGRESS
end

gate PROGRESS-002
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "Is the result a changed artifact, verified behavior, or bounded handoff rather than only a failure list?"
evidence result,artifact_or_behavior,handoff
YES PROGRESS-003
NO SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-PROGRESS
end

gate PROGRESS-003
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "Is progress supported by a changed artifact, verified behavior, checkpoint, or typed handoff—not only a heartbeat or live process?"
evidence progress,artifact_or_behavior,result,checks
YES PROGRESS-004
NO SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-PROGRESS
end

gate PROGRESS-004
context TASK_PROGRESS
question "When the worker missed its window or returned only failures, was it marked stalled and escalated or replaced?"
evidence window,failure,route,progress
YES COMPLETE
NO SOFT-REVIEW
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-PROGRESS
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The worker produced meaningful progress."
terminal HARD-STOP-PROGRESS HARD_STOP "Progress cannot be established within the governed window."
terminal SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The Campaign Orchestrator must review the stalled or weak result."
terminal UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "The progress claim is not supported by evidence."
